Lower Polk CBDJoin us on Thursday, December 3rd, for a special Holiday edition of Art Space at Lower Polk! Celebrate the season with an evening of local art, creativity, and holiday shopping. Explore a festive pop-up market featuring a rotating lineup of local artists and makers showcasing original artwork and handmade goods. Art Space at Lower Polk is a monthly pop-up gallery hosted at the Lower Polk Community Benefit District. Each First Thursday, we open our doors to the public, bringing together local artists and the community in a welcoming, creative space.
What to Expect:

Original artwork from local artists

Handmade goods and unique holiday gifts from local makers

A festive, relaxed gallery atmosphere

Indoor/Outdoor seating

Explore our festive mini pop-up market featuring original artwork, handmade goods, and unique gifts from local artists and makers.
